{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32954","headline":"和友人鸳鸯之什 三 · 崔珏","name":"和友人鸳鸯之什 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"舞鹤翔鸾俱别离，可怜生死两相随。\n红丝毳落眠汀处，白雪花成蹙浪时。\n琴上只闻交颈语，窗前空展共飞诗。\n何如相见长相对，肯羡人间多所思。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔珏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32954.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32954","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}